se article. If so, propose a concise title for a new knowledge base article and 2-3 key topics or resolution steps it should cover. This should be a distinct problem, not a minor variation of an existing knowledge base article.",useCase:"Review",roles:["Helpdesk Support","Customer Support","IT Ops","Program Management"]},{id:"convert-request-jql-query",title:"Convert request into JQL query",prompt:"Write a JQL query to find all unresolved bugs assigned to my team in the last 30 days.",useCase:"Execute",roles:["Engineering","Product","IT Ops"]},{id:"create-ab-testing-plan",title:"Create A/B testing plan",prompt:"Create a detailed A/B testing plan for `project/feature`. Start by defining the hypothesis and primary goal, specifying the variants to be tested, and identifying the key metric(s) for success. Outline the target audience and sample size, describe how users will be randomly assigned to each group, and set the test duration and timeline. Include steps for implementation, data collection, and analysis, and note any tools or platforms to be used. Finally, add placeholders for documenting results, learnings, and next steps, ensuring the plan is clear, actionable, and easy to adapt for different experiments, with space for users to add or modify details as needed.",useCase:"Create",roles:["Product","Marketing","Engineering","Design"]},{id:"create-background-research-plan",title:"Create background research plan",prompt:"Create a first draft or conduct background research on `topic/work item`. Summarise key points, relevant history, and provide links to supporting documents.",useCase:"Summarize",roles:["Product","Program Management","Engineering","Design"]},{id:"create-customer-onboarding-strategy",title:"Create customer onboarding strategy",prompt:"As a customer success lead, outline a clear customer onboarding strategy for `product or service`, including key objectives, main onboarding steps, communication touchpoints, and success metrics; highlight best practices for activation and engagement, and provide space for users to add project-specific details or adapt the strategy for different customer segments, ensuring the plan is concise, actionable, and easy to share with stakeholders.",useCase:"Create",roles:["Customer Support","Sales","Product","Program Management"]},{id:"create-product-requirements-document",title:"Create product requirements document",prompt:"Draft a PRD for `project/feature`. Depending on context such as OKRs, PRD, A/B test, retrospective, include objectives, hypotheses, requirements, metrics, learnings, and next steps.",useCase:"Create",roles:["Program Management","Design","Product","Engineering"]},{id:"edit-confluence-page-status",title:"Edit Confluence page status",prompt:"Update this page's status to Ready for Review: `Confluence page link`",useCase:"Execute",roles:["General","Engineering","Product","Program Management"]},{id:"explain-code",title:"Explain this code",prompt:"Explain what the code below does, describing its purpose, how it works, and any important details or logic involved. Use clear, concise language suitable for someone with basic programming knowledge. `Insert code snippet`.",useCase:"Learn",roles:["Engineering"]},{id:"extract-key-insights-datasets",title:"Extract key insights from datasets",prompt:"`Upload dataset file(s)` Based on the provided dataset, please analyze and present the top 5 most interesting observations, highlights, or trends, identifying segments that were more likely to respond in a certain way, significant patterns, or unexpected insights from the data.",useCase:"Analyze",roles:["Product","Marketing","Engineering"]},{id:"find-prioritize-open-pull-requests",title:"Find and prioritize open pull requests",prompt:"Summarize all my open pull requests in across all repositories I have access to in Bitbucket, as well as all pull requests where I'm assigned as a reviewer. Clearly indicate the number of pull requests pending my review and the total number of open PRs involving me. Group the results by repository and include key details such as PR title, status, author, and last updated date.",useCase:"Summarize",roles:["Engineering"]},{id:"find-overdue-jira-work-items",title:"Find overdue Jira work items for my team",prompt:"Show all overdue work items for my team, including links to them and how long they have been overdue.",useCase:"Find",roles:["Engineering","IT Ops","Helpdesk Support","Program Management"]},{id:"find-relevant-confluence-pages",title:"Find relevant Confluence pages",prompt:"For `work item ID/project/feature`, find and list any related Confluence pages or reference work items. Include links and a brief summary of how each is relevant.",useCase:"Find",roles:["Program Management","Product","Engineering"]},{id:"find-latest-company-policies",title:"Find the latest company policies",prompt:"How do I request reimbursements for my travels?",useCase:"Learn",roles:["General"]},{id:"generate-faq",title:"Generate an FAQ",prompt:"Map out the typical customer journey for `product/service`, from initial discovery through onboarding, usage, and support. Then, generate top FAQs that customers most frequently ask at each stage—covering how to get started, feature usage, troubleshooting, billing, and best practices—with concise, step-by-step answers formatted for a chatbot.",useCase:"Create",roles:["Customer Support","Program Management","Product","Marketing"]},{id:"generate-post-project-surveys",title:"Generate post-project surveys",prompt:"Create a comprehensive evaluation survey for `project` to assess the project's performance, including successes, challenges, areas for improvement, and lessons learned. Include questions such as scale, multiple choice, and open answer covering: objectives and outcomes, budget and resources, team performance and collaboration, challenges and problem-solving, stakeholder satisfaction, and recommendations for future projects.",useCase:"Create",roles:["Program Management","Product","General"]},{id:"learn-company-procedure-information",title:"Learn about company procedure information",prompt:"Summarize the standard procedures for `process/activity` across the company. Include step-by-step instructions and reference documents.",useCase:"Summarize",roles:["General","IT Ops","Program Management"]},{id:"review-improve-writing",title:"Review and improve writing",prompt:"Rewrite the following message to make it more clear, concise, and professional while retaining all key details: `Insert message here`.",useCase:"Review",roles:["General","Sales","Customer Support"]},{id:"search-policies-questionnaires",title:"Search policies related to questionnaires",prompt:"Search all internal security and compliance policies and provide answers to the following questionnaire. Reference policy documents and highlight relevant sections for each answer.",useCase:"Find",roles:["Security","IT Ops"]},{id:"suggest-process-streamlining",title:"Suggest process streamlining",prompt:"Suggest ways to streamline the process for `process/task`. Identify steps that can be automated or simplified to reduce manual work and produce more succinct outputs.",useCase:"Learn",roles:["Program Management","IT Ops","Engineering"]},{id:"summarize-track-project-updates",title:"Summarize and track project updates",prompt:"Summarize the status and history of `project/topic/feature`. Include key initiatives, progress made, stakeholders, decisions, timelines, and relevant documents. Highlight upcoming milestones or blockers.",useCase:"Summarize",roles:["General","Engineering","Product","Program Management"]},{id:"summarize-meeting-notes",title:"Summarize meeting notes",prompt:"Summarize the meeting with the transcript `attach file or paste transcript`, including main topics discussed, key decisions, and action items.",useCase:"Summarize",roles:["General"]},{id:"synthesize-user-testing-findings",title:"Synthesize findings from user testing",prompt:"Synthesize key insights from my user testing: `Confluence page link/transcript`. Identify the top pain points or issues that users faced during the testing. Categorize these issues by severity and impact on user experience.",useCase:"Analyze",roles:["Design"]},{id:"visualize-data-charts",title:"Visualize your data into charts",prompt:"`Upload your dataset file(s)` Based on the uploaded dataset file, determine the most effective way to visualize the data. Identify the key structure and variables within the dataset and the most likely user goals for this data, to suggest and describe the most appropriate type of visualization.",useCase:"Analyze",roles:["Product","Engineering","Marketing"]}],p=[{id:"create-release",title:"Create release",prompt:"/create-release in this `Jira space` to create a new release with start and release dates. Include completed work items and summarize what's included by epic or team.",useCase:"Create",roles:["Program Management","Engineering"],tags:["jira-releases"]},{id:"manage-jira-workflows",title:"Manage Jira workflows",prompt:"/manage-jira-workflows for this `Jira space` to analyze its workflow: explain statuses, transitions, top workflow rules, and propose simplifications.",useCase:"Execute",roles:["IT Ops","Program Management"],tags:["jira-workflows"]},{id:"analyze-incident-root-cause",title:"Find root cause of an incident (RCA)",prompt:"/analyze-incident-root-cause for this `JSM incident` to analyze details, linked alerts, changes, assets, and similar incidents. Propose likely root cause and investigation steps.",useCase:"Analyze",roles:["IT Ops"],enableDeepResearch:!0},{id:"find-incident-root-cause",title:"Find incident root cause",prompt:"/find-incident-root-cause for this `JSM incident` to infer the most likely root cause and provide a stakeholder-friendly summary.",useCase:"Find",roles:["IT Ops","General"],enableDeepResearch:!0},{id:"find-similar-incidents",title:"Find similar incidents",prompt:"/find-similar-incidents for this `JSM incident` to find the most similar historical incidents, how t