rize my team's last three Confluence meeting notes into a single page of action items",description:"Prompt for day 2 of the year"},promptOfDayPrompt3:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.prompt-of-day.prompt-3",defaultMessage:"Scan Jira for issues assigned to me this week and draft a priorities list in plain language",description:"Prompt for day 3 of the year"},promptOfDayPrompt4:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.prompt-of-day.prompt-4",defaultMessage:"Create a one-page explainer of what my team does, using my team's Confluence space as input",description:"Prompt for day 4 of the year"},promptOfDayPrompt5:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.prompt-of-day.prompt-5",defaultMessage:"Turn my recent stand-up notes into a clear update I can paste into Slack",description:"Prompt for day 5 of the year"},promptOfDayPrompt6:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.prompt-of-day.prompt-6",defaultMessage:"Teach me the basics of writing good Jira tickets, using examples tailored to my role",description:"Prompt for day 6 of the year"},promptOfDayPrompt7:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.prompt-of-day.prompt-7",defaultMessage:"Find all Jira bugs I've reported in the last month and summarize recurring themes",description:"Prompt for day 7 of the year"},promptOfDayPrompt8:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.prompt-of-day.prompt-8",defaultMessage:"Read a long Confluence RFC and generate a 5-bullet TL;DR for non-technical stakeholders",description:"Prompt for day 8 of the year"},promptOfDayPrompt9:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.prompt-of-day.prompt-9",defaultMessage:"Propose a checklist template for launching a new feature in my product",description:"Prompt for day 9 of the year"},promptOfDayPrompt10:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.prompt-of-day.prompt-10",defaultMessage:"Compare two Confluence pages and point out what changed in simple language",description:"Prompt for day 10 of the year"},promptOfDayPrompt11:{id:"rovo-conversation-actions.prompt-of-day.prompt-11",defaultMessage:"Draft an agenda for my next 1:1 base