 navigation within the AI conversation interface that opens the agent creation interface. Shown as the text on a button. When clicked, it opens a dialog or form allowing users to create a new AI agent. The purpose is to provide users with a way to create custom AI agents from the side navigation."},chatListLabel:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.chat-list",defaultMessage:"Chats",description:"Label text displayed as a section heading in the side navigation within the AI conversation interface, identifying the list of past chat conversations. Shown as a section title or heading. The purpose is to identify the chats section, which displays the user's conversation history."},closeSideNavLabel:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.close-side-nav",defaultMessage:"Close",description:"Button label displayed on the close button in the side navigation within the AI conversation interface. Shown as the text on a button. When clicked, it closes or collapses the side navigation panel. The purpose is to provide users with a way to hide the side navigation to get more screen space for the main chat interface."},giveFeedbackLabel:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.give-feedback",defaultMessage:"Give feedback",description:"Button label displayed on a feedback button in the side navigation within the AI conversation interface that opens a feedback form or dialog. Shown as the text on a button. When clicked, it opens a feedback interface allowing users to submit feedback about the AI assistant or the interface. The purpose is to provide users with a way to share their thoughts and help improve the product."},pulseLabel:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.digest.V2",defaultMessage:"Digest",description:"Button label for navigating to the digest."},tasksLabel:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.tasks",defaultMessage:"Tasks",description:"Button label for navigating to the tasks view in the Rovo side navigation."},libraryLabel:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.library",defaultMessage:"Library",description:"Button label for navigating to the Library view in the Rovo side navigation."},spacesSectionLabel:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.spaces-section",defaultMessage:"Rovo spaces",description:"Label for the expandable spaces section in Rovo chat global side navigation, shown next to the folder icon."},createSpaceLabel:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.create-rovo-space",defaultMessage:"Create Rovo space",description:"Accessibility label for the add button next to the projects section in Rovo chat global side navigation."},recommendedSpaces:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.recommended-spaces",defaultMessage:"Recommended Rovo spaces",description:"Button label for navigating to the recommended spaces view in the Rovo side navigation."},recommendedSpacesLabel:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.recommended-spaces-label",defaultMessage:"Recommended Rovo spaces",description:"Accessibility label for the AI sparkle icon next to the recommended spaces button."},firstTimeModalHeadline:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.first-time-modal-headline",defaultMessage:"Rovo spaces have landed in chat",description:"Headline for the first-time recommended Rovo spaces modal."},firstTimeModalBodyOne:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.first-time-modal-body-one",defaultMessage:"Spaces let you group your knowledge around a topic, project, or team, so when you chat with Rovo, it knows exactly where to look for answers instead of providing a general answer.",description:"First body paragraph for the first-time recommended Rovo spaces modal."},firstTimeModalBodyTwo:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.first-time-modal-body-two",defaultMessage:"Add knowledge sources like Confluence pages, Google Drive files, or Slack channels, and Rovo will answer from them first.",description:"Second body paragraph for the first-time recommended Rovo spaces modal."},fir